# Pages, routing, layouts

- **Stories:** `src/pages/stories/[id].astro`: `StoryLayout` (article, sidebar, ad banner, related stories).
- **Sports:** `src/pages/sports/[sport].astro` builds one front per sport in `src/lib/sports.ts`.
- **Writers:** Index `src/pages/writers/index.astro`; profiles `src/pages/writers/[id].astro`: `WriterLayout`.
- **Legal:** `src/pages/legal/[...slug].astro`: `LegalLayout`.
- **RSS:** `/rss.xml` is generated by `src/pages/rss.xml.js` from the `stories` collection, linking to `/stories/{id}/`.
- **No shell:** `signin` and `signup` pass `hideNavigation hideFooter` to `BaseLayout`.
- Detail routes only build paths and pass `id` and `frontmatter={entry.data}` to their layout, with `<Content />` in the slot.
- Pages import `BaseLayout` (or a detail layout) and compose section components; keep markup out of `src/pages`.
- When adding a route, follow the same `getStaticPaths` + `getCollection` + `render` pattern as sibling files, and add it to `/system/overview`.
